Date: Thu, 8 Oct 2026 00:54:08 -0600
Subject: [PATCH 1227/1286] HERESY 1169: no measure on a paragraph: the hints,
 the guide, the cheat-sheet and the rooms' notes flow to the edge of their
 box; the empty lists say theirs in one paragraph
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Viktor 08.10.2026: «Снова ловлю тебя на хардкорных переносах строк… Внеси себе в устав НИКОГДА НЕ ЛОМАТЬ СТРОКУ. И дополнительно в твой покаянный TODO - пройтись по всему коду и вернуть ломанные строки в их текущие autowrap праграфы». Gone: .row-hint's 68ch, .hint's 62ch, the guide's 78ch and 80ch, the cheat-sheet's 150ch (half his 2K screen left empty), the rooms' notes' 430 px (they take the leftover of their row now, so the room's name stays whole), and the <br> inside the empty lists' sentences (the joined texts translated in the six catalogs from the pieces they had).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
